      "id": "claim_e50fe24180774453a761ed8c42b36d4e",
      "statement": "SANDMAN's build tooling is fixed: Python parts are managed with uv only (uv workspace at the root, Python >= 3.13, < 3.14, single uv.lock), and Java parts are built with Maven only (JDK 21 via maven.compiler.release=21, enforcer requiring Maven >= 3.9 and Java >= 21); CI runs uv sync --locked and mvn -B verify.",
