    {
      "id": "claim_4cb74a616f1846cc8c6b21a53f7c77dc",
      "statement": "Agent frameworks are forbidden (NFR-3) and the ban is enforced from two sides: `make guard` fails if any Python file under libs/ or services/ imports langchain, langgraph, deepagents, llama_index, crewai or autogen, and the Maven enforcer bans dev.langchain4j, org.springframework.ai and org.bsc.langgraph4j dependencies (LangChain4j tolerated only as a transitive dependency of the reused ArDoCo/LiSSA adapters).",
      "evidence": [
