    {
      "id": "claim_b38fcce2f5894e4d9d4394dd88d78c20",
      "statement": "The default pytest run (`uv run pytest`, i.e. `make test-py`) never executes the e2e suite: the root pyproject.toml lists testpaths as libs/python, services, tools, tests/plugin-stubs, tests/conformance and scripts — tests/e2e is excluded — so the walking skeleton is reachable only through `make e2e` or a manually started stack with SANDMAN_E2E=1.",
