      "id": "claim_e2797350deb14303857214789a202a81",
      "statement": "Container-backed integration tests are part of the ordinary test targets and auto-skip when no Docker daemon is reachable (e.g. the Python library's Memgraph/NATS tests use a pytestmark of skipif on a docker.from_env().ping() probe), so `make test` works without Docker but does not exercise real graph/event semantics.",
