      "id": "claim_844c820d901944b7a1c9aea36c90db20",
      "statement": "The uv workspace spans one shared Python library plus the Python services, the CLI and the plugin stubs (members: libs/python/*, services/orchestrator, services/extraction-agent, services/query-service, services/llm-replay, tools/cli, tests/plugin-stubs), while the Maven aggregator covers libs/java/agent-lib, libs/java/agent-lib-a2a, services/tlr-agent and services/inconsistency-agent — the language split is deliberate: Python for parsing/LLM-heavy services, Java/Quarkus where ArDoCo and LiSSA run in-process.",
