      "id": "claim_96d31af3e7e64c86bdc48c7df7ec0b17",
      "statement": "Runtime YAML configuration lives in config/ and is mounted read-only at /config by the services that consume it: config/orchestrator/rules.yaml (debounce, timeouts, retries, TLR kind pairs), config/tlr/approaches.yaml, config/extraction/plugins.yaml and config/inconsistency/plugins.yaml (plugin registration), config/query/intents.yaml and config/query/plugins.yaml — behavior changes that look like code changes are often just these files.",
