      "id": "claim_6b8140653ab64cf89f9a83d49d431bca",
      "statement": "The `sandman` CLI (tools/cli, distribution sandman-cli, entrypoint sandman_cli.__main__:main, default base URL http://127.0.0.1:8080 = the edge proxy) is the machine-facing ingestion and workflow front door: it talks only to the query-service API, which forwards owner operations, so the CLI never needs service addresses.",
